    	<text id="title" position="relative" anim="none"><![CDATA[<div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-12 col-md-9 col-lg-7 col-xl-6"><p class="p_answer text-center mt-0 pt-0">We might not be on the coast, but we’ve got enough shoreline to make you think twice. Minnesota is full of little surprises. So before you overlook us, we dare you to learn something about us first.</p></div></div>]]></text>

