				<text id="option4" position="relative" margin-bottom="10" anim="show" animtime="1"  animdelay="0.5" event="optionover,selectandsubmit" class="optionBox"><![CDATA[<p class="p_option">19</p>]]></text>
			</option>

			<!-- feedbacks -->
			<fb id="pass" event="">

				<text id="txt1" position="relative" anim="show" animtime="1" andimdelay="0.1" margin-top="30" margin-bottom="30"><![CDATA[<div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-12 col-md-9 col-lg-7 col-xl-6"><p class="p_result">16 is correct!</p><p class="text-left p_answer">16 <em>Fortune</em>  500 companies are headquartered in Minnesota, with a majority located in downtown Minneapolis.  The list includes such businesses as Target, Best Buy, 3M, General Mills, Medtronic, Hormel Foods, Ameriprise Financial, and Ecolab.</p><p class="text-left p_answer">Positioned in the heart of this thriving business community, the Carlson School maintains strong relationships with these companies in order to offer its students essential, real-world experiences in the classroom. Students gain experiential learning through <a href="https://carlsonschool.umn.edu/enterprise-programs" target="_blank">Enterprise Programs</a> and internships as well as develop connections for <a href="https://carlsonschool.umn.edu/career-services/employment-reports" target="_blank">recruiting opportunities</a> after graduation.</p></div></div>]]></text>

				<button id="nextQBtn" position="relative" margin="auto" width="150" margin-bottom="30" anim="none" event="btnover,loadNextQuestion"><![CDATA[Next question]]></button>
			</fb>

			<fb id="fail" event="">

				<text id="txt1" position="relative"  anim="show" animtime="1" andimdelay="0.1" margin-bottom="30" margin-top="30"><![CDATA[<div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-12 col-md-9 col-lg-7 col-xl-6"><p class="p_result">It’s 16.</p><p class="text-left p_answer">16 <em>Fortune</em> 500 companies are headquartered in Minnesota, with a majority located in downtown Minneapolis.  The list includes such businesses as Target, Best Buy, 3M, General Mills, Medtronic, Hormel Foods, Ameriprise Financial, and Ecolab.</p><p class="text-left p_answer">Positioned in the heart of this thriving business community, the Carlson School maintains strong relationships with these companies in order to offer its students essential, real-world experiences in the classroom. Students gain experiential learning through <a href="https://carlsonschool.umn.edu/enterprise-programs" target="_blank">Enterprise Programs</a> and internships as well as develop connections for <a href="https://carlsonschool.umn.edu/career-services/employment-reports" target="_blank">recruiting opportunities</a> after graduation.</p></div></div>]]></text>

